it room, gazing out at the vibrant hues of the sunset glow that paint the sky in shades of orange, pink, and purple. The window reflects the soft evening light, creating a serene and tranquil atmosphere.\n\nBeside her, a small black puppy is curled up peacefully on a fluffy cream-colored rug, its ears slightly twitching with the gentle evening breeze flowing through the open window. The background is minimalistic and clean, emphasizing the warm tones of the sunset and the comforting ambiance of the home. The room is adorned with subtle details, such as a potted plant on the windowsill and a wooden side table with a simple lamp.\n\nThe illustration is rendered in ultra-high definition, with smooth lines and rich, harmonious colors. At the top of the image, elegant black Chinese calligraphy characters read: \"愿她被这个世界温柔以待\" (\"May she be treated gently by the world\"), adding a touch of poetic warmth and depth to the composition. The overall scene conveys a sense of peace, hope, and quiet beauty, evoking feelings of healing and gentle care."], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 163, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 124, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 17}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "query_output", "slot_index": 0, "links": [163], "label": "query_output", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "query_output"}], "size": [454.1501770019531, 300.828125], "pos": [989.1439819335938, 1951.954345703125], "widgets_values": ["one girl", "a 18 y.o girl wearing blouse,(from above:1.1),from side,soft lighting,high resolution,professional grade,RAW photography,evocative composition,Cinematic Lighting,moody lighting,perfect eyes,depth of field,virtual background,eyes focus,the face of an angel", "一只狗", 690, "randomize"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "support_sample_input"}, "name": "support_sample_input", "label": "support_sample_input", "